# Find The Needle, Korean.
#
# An empty msgstr is not a bug: it means the string falls back to its message
# id, which is the English source text. See docs/localization/PLAN.md.
#
# Korean has one plural form, so every plural entry here carries a single
# msgstr[0] and the count sits in it as a number with its counter ("3개").
#
# Style: 해요체 for sentences, short nouns for buttons, never 당신. A button or
# key the player reads elsewhere is quoted in single quotes ('옵션'). No dash as
# punctuation, the same rule as every other file here.
#
# To bring this file up to date after the English has moved:
#     python scripts/dev/gen_pot.py --merge ko
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Find The Needle\n"
"Language: ko\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

msgid "SMALL"
msgstr "소형"

msgid "Designed for weaker computers. A shorter hunt with room to walk around the pile."
msgstr "저사양 컴퓨터용이에요. 바늘 찾기가 짧고, 더미 둘레를 걸어 다닐 공간도 넉넉해요."

msgid "STANDARD"
msgstr "표준"

msgid "The yard as it comes. The pile the game was built around, under one steel roof."
msgstr "기본 마당이에요. 이 게임의 기준이 되는 더미를 강철 지붕 하나가 덮고 있어요."

msgid "BIG"
msgstr "대형"

msgid "Twice the hay and a crown that stands over the wall plates. Bring a belt."
msgstr "건초가 두 배이고, 꼭대기가 벽보다 높이 솟아 있어요. 벨트 챙기세요."

msgid "HUGE"
msgstr "초대형"

msgid "Eight storeys of straw. The shed goes out to meet it and the roof still loses. Slow to load."
msgstr "8층 높이의 건초예요. 창고가 넓어져도 지붕이 감당을 못 해요. 불러오는 데 오래 걸려요."

msgid "THE MOUNTAIN"
msgstr "산더미"

msgid "Fifty metres. It does not fit under the roof, it is not supposed to, and you will not finish it. Takes a minute to pour."
msgstr "50미터. 지붕 아래에 안 들어가는데, 원래 그런 거예요. 다 치우지도 못할 거예요. 쌓는 데 1분쯤 걸려요."

